{# Phase 5: Evolutionary optimization via gpa-evolution delegate (high only) #}
{# goal: Evolve the prompt over (quality, cost) Pareto frontier with textual gradients. #}
{#
  Group: G (Prompt Enhancement — evolutionary optimization)
  Delegates the core GEPA loop to gpa-evolution's reflect/mutate/test/update
