Return JSON only:
```json
{
  "frontier": [
    {"id": "v1", "prompt": "full text", "quality_score": 0.85, "cost_score": 120, "dominates": ["v0"]}
  ],
  "best_member": "the full text of the frontier member to use as the final enhanced prompt",
  "convergence_metric": 0.08,
  "trajectories": [
